---
// Atmospheric Hero component: Machined Titanium & Anodized Green Hardware
---

<header class="hero-container">
  <!-- Location Bezel -->
  <div class="location-bezel">
    <span class="led-diode-green"></span>
    <span class="engraved-label">San Francisco Bay Area</span>
    <span class="status-divider">•</span>
    <span class="status-mode">On-Site & Hybrid Ready</span>
  </div>

  <h1 class="hero-headline">
    Native iOS & Android from a single <span class="gradient-metal-duo">Kotlin</span> codebase.
  </h1>

  <p class="hero-subheadline">
    Staff Mobile Software Engineer & KMP Architect. Eliminating the 2x native engineering burn rate for high-growth startups without cross-platform performance compromises.
  </p>

  <!-- In-Person Coffee Readout -->
  <div class="hardware-readout">
    <div class="readout-header">
      <span class="readout-screws">&bull;</span>
      <span class="engraved-label">[ IN-PERSON COFFEE CONSULTING ]</span>
      <span class="readout-screws">&bull;</span>
    </div>
    <div class="readout-body">
      <p class="readout-text">
        <strong>Sharing a coffee shop or event right now?</strong> Tap my shoulder for <em>unlimited free technical consulting</em> on your startup's mobile architecture.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-cta-group">
    <a href="#consulting" class="button btn-anodized-green">
      <span>Book Free 30-Min Audit</span>
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
    </a>
    <a href="#contact" class="button btn-titanium">
      <span>Say Hi / Grab Coffee</span>
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8h1a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-1"></path><path d="M2 8h16v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H6a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V8z"></path><line x1="6" y1="1" x2="6" y2="4"></line><line x1="10" y1="1" x2="10" y2="4"></line><line x1="14" y1="1" x2="14" y2="4"></line></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero-container {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 1rem 2.5rem;
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .location-bezel {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #181b21 0%, #111317 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--chamfer-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--chamfer-light);
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1),
      0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    padding: 7px 16px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .status-divider {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }

  .status-mode {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--anodized-green-edge);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .hero-headline {
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .gradient-metal-duo {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #76e3ab 0%, #48a574 40%, #b993f7 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(118, 227, 171, 0.25);
  }

  .hero-subheadline {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.5vw, 1.25rem);
    color: var(--text-metal-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .hardware-readout {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #15181e 0%, #0d0f13 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--chamfer-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(118, 227, 171, 0.35); /* Subtle green anodized top chamfer */
    box-shadow: 
      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08),
      0 12px 24px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 700px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .readout-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .readout-screws {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 0;
  }

  .readout-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-laser-white);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .readout-text strong {
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .readout-text em {
    color: var(--anodized-green-edge);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero-cta-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .btn-anodized-green {
    padding: 0 28px;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .btn-titanium {
    padding: 0 26px;
  }
</style>
